9f82b4ab582/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:05:03Z","email":"zhanglun1410@gmail.com","name":"zhanglun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:05:03Z","email":"zhanglun1410@gmail.com","name":"zhanglun"},"message":"refactor(ui): 邮差猫改运行时实测几何编排（WAAPI 闭合回路）\n\n根因：此前是开环 CSS 编排，所有跳跃数学假设轨道宽 T=988px。\n真实 T=100cqw-92px 随视口变——障碍按 T 百分比缩放、跳窗按时间\n百分比固定、猫与障碍像素尺寸不缩放，三者只在 988px 相交；\n窗口 900px 时抛物线边缘 22.8px 已低于箱顶 24px，必然穿模。\n\n- Layout.astro 内联脚本：getBoundingClientRect 实测轨道宽与\n  障碍位置/宽/高 → 生成 WAAPI 关键帧（X 线性分段 / Y 抛物线 /\n  瞬时翻转），跳窗半宽由重叠半宽与净空反推\n- ResizeObserver 重排、IntersectionObserver 出视口暂停、\n  reduced-motion 不启动；无第三方库（WAAPI 原生够用）\n- 删除手写 cat-patrol/cat-hop/cat-flip 关键帧（-105 行）\n- 镜像数学全带宽扫描：500–1400px 每跳净空 ≥5px，锚点合法","tree":{"sha":"c5b40829ab4c8fb5c3b58fe8654fa30f626a664a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhanglun/zhanglun.github.io/git/trees/c5b40829ab4c8fb5c3b58fe8654fa30f626a664a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhanglun/zhanglun.github.io/git/commits/5119ad83896ffffd9bc1f53bc94d19f82b4ab582","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3086358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhanglun","id":3086358,"login":"zhanglun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODYzNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglun/subscriptions","ty