qdQiRxVcKvhY23LFLKgb+\nlTuRweSdUKA5hsHauP9w\n=ebyT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T16:30:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/2529805314254e025ec89db8874c91f3f58df2ec","node_id":"C_kwDOAUuXCdoAKDI1Mjk4MDUzMTQyNTRlMDI1ZWM4OWRiODg3NGM5MWYzZjU4ZGYyZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973","sha":"7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973"}],"sha":"2529805314254e025ec89db8874c91f3f58df2ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/2529805314254e025ec89db8874c91f3f58df2ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:14:40Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:14:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gnss): make antenna fromCenter positive to starboard (#2943)\n\n* fix(gnss): make fromCenter positive to starboard\n\nsensors.*.fromCenter was the only signed athwartships quantity declaring\n+ve to port, against rudderAngle, attitude.roll, attitude.yaw,\nrateOfTurn, thrustAngle and keel.angle, which are all +ve to starboard.\n\nThe mismatch was load-bearing here rather than cosmetic: lever-arm\ncorrection combines fromCenter with a heading taken from the same body\nframe as attitude.yaw, so a port-positive offset against a\nstarboard-positive rotation forced a bespoke rotation matrix. With +y to\nstarboard the body-to-earth transform collapses to the standard NED\nrotation, and the comment documenting the deviation goes away.\n\nNet behaviour is unchanged for a given physical antenna: the same\nmounting position now written +2 instead of -2 yields an identical CCRP.\nVerified across multiple headings and offsets, including off-axis cases\nwhere a sign error in one rotation term cannot cancel out.\n\nThis also resolves an existing self-contradiction: @signalk/path-metadata\nhas described fromCenter as \"positive towards starboard\" since v2.28.0,\nwhile the OpenAPI description and the admin UI said the opposite.\n\nIn BoatSchematicEditor the SVG mapping loses its sign flip, since SVG x\ngrows rightward, which is now the same direction as positive fromCenter.\n\nAdds a lever-arm case with both body components non-zero and an off-axis\nheading, so a future rotation-sign regression cannot pass on the\nsymmetric due-north fixtures alone.\n\nNote on stored values: settings.gnssSensors has only shipped in\n2.31.0-beta, so there are no stable-release configs to migrate. Legacy\nsensors.gps.fromCenter and /vessel''s gpsFromCenter are passed through\nunchanged rather than silently negated; because the shipped metadata and\nthe shipped UI disagreed, existing values are of ambiguous handedness and\nare better re-checked by the user than rewritten by the server.\n\n* docs(gnss): clarify the sign-convention wording\n\nAddress review: state that SVG x increases to the right rather than the\nambiguous \"grows in\", and complete the subject in the admin UI guidance\nsentence.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e6c585bb7e3e7fb86eea4e6fd65756818bb290c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/3e6c585bb7e3e7fb86eea4e6fd65756818bb290c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e6c585bb7e3e7fb86eea4e6fd65756818bb290c\nparent f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1791044080 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791044080 +0300\n\nfix(gnss): make antenna fromCenter positive to starboard (#2943)\n\n* fix(gnss): make fromCenter positive to starboard\n\nsensors.*.fromCenter was the only signed athwartships quantity declaring\n+ve to port, against rudderAngle, attitude.roll, attitude.yaw,\nrateOfTurn, thrustAngle and keel.angle, which are all +ve to starboard.\n\nThe mismatch was load-bearing here rather than cosmetic: lever-arm\ncorrection combines fromCenter with a heading taken from the same body\nframe as attitude.yaw, so a port-positive offset against a\nstarboard-positive rotation forced a bespoke rotation matrix. With +y to\nstarboard the body-to-earth transform collapses to the standard NED\nrotation, and the comment documenting the deviation goes away.\n\nNet behaviour is unchanged for a given physical antenna: the same\nmounting position now written +2 instead of -2 yields an identical CCRP.\nVerified across multiple headings and offsets, including off-axis cases\nwhere a sign error in one rotation term cannot cancel out.\n\nThis also resolves an existing self-contradiction: @signalk/path-metadata\nhas described fromCenter as \"positive towards starboard\" since v2.28.0,\nwhile the OpenAPI description and the admin UI said the opposite.\n\nIn BoatSchematicEditor the SVG mapping loses its sign flip, since SVG x\ngrows rightward, which is now the same direction as positive fromCenter.\n\nAdds a lever-arm case with both body components non-zero and an off-axis\nheading, so a future rotation-sign regression cannot pass on the\nsymmetric due-north fixtures alone.\n\nNote on stored values: settings.gnssSensors has only shipped in\n2.31.0-beta, so there are no stable-release configs to migrate. Legacy\nsensors.gps.fromCenter and /vessel''s gpsFromCenter are passed through\nunchanged rather than silently negated; because the shipped metadata and\nthe shipped UI disagreed, existing values are of ambiguous handedness and\nare better re-checked by the user than rewritten by the server.\n\n* docs(gnss): clarify the sign-convention wording\n\nAddress review: state that SVG x increases to the right rather than the\nambiguous \"grows in\", and complete the subject in the admin UI guidance\nsentence.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwSnwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYHIQAJkgHNmfDZ3XNHF1ue9KhDfZ\nbFjU34Tld5bu4hh+mxGVP00Dkko7Ri0Qgf6MMzLEur66Ghq8d8AsRR6bJp7AxXcn\naaq5nO6Uoh1eFW1WxuoRbTbarTq691s0ftK1zrA6HIL2yqbbZVkEbNUwjFvlqj+o\nxqvtTyEYrkAPoMoun4PkisUZ2o5B7gyhcb6SzF1PUl6bTth+PdnqWzouYLEkoSGy\ny7qRP4bUpzvM+hfP5liWhp+k9cAMy9EBWNzzUGdZpbbQKsnlAhoeCDbgaCerQ0/t\ncNjwhOxRN8P6vlk0csg1h12hXhu2VKQlFKPHSu7V2BfM3acgK8Q6J4VSF3OuH1vS\nQiWgSieVqOPPCw5GnBBjEJ5H/US78cXol62OsHDC+LtfMNMDwfsLaa5vpcuKyxZh\nfuiiB7UdVe28SCt7lx5bCQ4Ih3VKsb8TQYoeEJ+ePGpOCkpz+nYNaW0pztt45B4D\n7QIP05uI1r4vAEunJWtAqPWkT3KfgDfqsCEFDYTRbsrRvSnvzu74UmnxwC0etz4H\nJnuFtPGWONnLoQy6+UqrHFiXc9SwEI6RANTvOtGbroASqKJ/4t2CGVLgWQIGE59p\nMUe63e62CozPkqVmjqcPRP2dpbptuVIJgWlkH6CoYDXg/1fVERn/ONx7NRjCz8qt\nVWGLh8ySuMoP0cTD0DH9\n=SmBy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T16:14:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973","node_id":"C_kwDOAUuXCdoAKDdjY2E0YTRhYjhlNWNhNzcwZDJkNzQ2OWMzNzEzZWVjMmEzYzQ5NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36","sha":"f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36"}],"sha":"7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/7cca4a4ab8e5ca770d2d7469c3713eec2a3c4973"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:09:32Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:56:32Z","email":"teppo.kurki@iki.fi","name":"Teppo Kurki"},"message":"chore(plugin-ci): drop the armv7 / Node 20 job\n\nThe armv7 job tests plugins on Node 20 under QEMU, to match Venus OS 3.70\non the Cerbo GX. Signal K Server now requires Node.js 22 or later and no\nlonger supports armv7 (docs/breaking_changes.md), so the job tests an\nenvironment current servers do not run in.\n\nIt is also the slowest and least reliable leg: plugins with a larger test\nsuite no longer fit its 30-minute cap under emulation, so it fails on\nnearly every run while being advisory, which teaches authors to ignore a\nred check.\n\nThe enable-armv7 input stays as a deprecated, ignored option, so callers\nthat still pass it keep validating.","tree":{"sha":"efece710e4049371563bd057f21bf3a8877b6edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/efece710e4049371563bd057f21bf3a8877b6edd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1049678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tkurki","id":1049678,"login":"tkurki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDk2Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/f5e91aa74817ca14bbff6b4ae47f8c83f3fe0b36","node_id":"C_kwDOAUuXCdoAKGY1ZTkxYWE3NDgxN2NhMTRiYmZmNmI0YWU0N2Y4YzgzZjNmZTBiMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"