rkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/1fb1d9bcc8b582f9158fc6966deeb199116e3184/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:53:30Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:53:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: explain that source priority does not apply to raw NMEA 0183 on port 10110 (#3087)\n\n* docs: explain that source priority does not apply to raw NMEA 0183\n\nSentences from NMEA 0183 connections are forwarded to port 10110 as\nthey arrive, before conversion, so source priority never filters them.\nUsers who rank two GPS receivers still see both on port 10110.\n\nDocument this on the Source Priority page, together with the setup\nthat does give a priority-filtered NMEA 0183 feed: rank the group,\nsuppress the raw event on the input connections and let\nsignalk-to-nmea0183 build the sentences from the filtered data.\n\n* docs: describe the NMEA 0183 output conceptually\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Teppo Kurki <teppo.kurki@iki.fi>","tree":{"sha":"00bd4c45a0a3643c28c7760b3c50effd166ea3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/00bd4c45a0a3643c28c7760b3c50effd166ea3ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/1fb1d9bcc8b582f9158fc6966deeb199116e3184","verification":{"payload":"tree 00bd4c45a0a3643c28c7760b3c50effd166ea3ce\nparent 01c46e036bb601751c63b7740db4ed7f633b9e7a\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1790708010 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790708010 +0300\n\ndocs: explain that source priority does not apply to raw NMEA 0183 on port 10110 (#3087)\n\n* docs: explain that source priority does not apply to raw NMEA 0183\n\nSentences from NMEA 0183 connections are forwarded to port 10110 as\nthey arrive, before conversion, so source priority never filters them.\nUsers who rank two GPS receivers still see both on port 10110.\n\nDocument this on the Source Priority page, together with the setup\nthat does give a priority-filtered NMEA 0183 feed: rank the group,\nsuppress the raw event on the input connections and let\nsignalk-to-nmea0183 build the sentences from the filtered data.\n\n* docs: describe the NMEA 0183 output conceptually\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n* Update docs/setup/source-priority.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Teppo Kurki <teppo.kurki@iki.fi>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvAkqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAqQQAI8UxQPWOTkkpSv+EoTei3XD\nGfm4ZNGwooehZEblZp4F8Mh13YSr56jZjazgZqYqUi7bByN0DZnEmfqBzH0YJuRS\n9ejHYWYLV6tTLXA2u3dNNuxPdWj/7r7PJso3blYXBUZBO2igGkNYc2Da2GmbExWJ\n3/UyYmOpp0j5jYcnjyJDwSZUgMNijNGrNQA0tcRQPQUsGmLtLNxA/zVyIyJ/M2S3\ngqnNydcvmerTdLhSFTVwx8F9IssOgbHbYAYQKtCWwokleLvR1kNiou1oCxkMIbtk\n52UdsPXT4Al1PalyPG6GzCBIr1O1a2PK+whY2lQ4HJjxM8MGtEl5wcFm3LYaD/vE\nCBlJnnxQB5m6fLQhB45X3A9i1IhFfHBZRAwW++rKJCwG9lUBXdBxSTEkIN4TET2s\nM/bvy6moAuGXUV8U+eh0ClKEVwDPiMUUlr+8gc29SdpXoMF1jEvQnxEeMfESRUfn\n0S6OtvGnF8Q5CpZLZwmKE