:"2026-09-08T18:44:19Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:44:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: throttle PROVIDERSTATUS server events (#2974)\n\nsetPluginStatus/setProviderStatus emitted the full provider status\nlist on every call. A plugin calling it in a loop pushes megabytes\nper second into every admin-UI WebSocket; the socket buffers grow\nuntil the connection is cut and the Data Browser''s own subscription\ndata queues behind the backlog (#2972: 196 MB on one socket, ~2.4\nMB/s).\n\nCoalesce calls into at most one PROVIDERSTATUS emit per second,\ntrailing edge, so the admin UI still sees the latest status promptly\nwhile a chatty caller can no longer flood the socket. The 5-second\nperiodic full refresh is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"721bb35399ade5d89ed079dce00d4cb6a4bafdf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/721bb35399ade5d89ed079dce00d4cb6a4bafdf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/316751ad464352ec18f68da224c6cc1b58773ad5","verification":{"payload":"tree 721bb35399ade5d89ed079dce00d4cb6a4bafdf6\nparent 2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1788893059 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788893059 +0300\n\nfix: throttle PROVIDERSTATUS server events (#2974)\n\nsetPluginStatus/setProviderStatus emitted the full provider status\nlist on every call. A plugin calling it in a loop pushes megabytes\nper second into every admin-UI WebSocket; the socket buffers grow\nuntil the connection is cut and the Data Browser''s own subscription\ndata queues behind the backlog (#2972: 196 MB on one socket, ~2.4\nMB/s).\n\nCoalesce calls into at most one PROVIDERSTATUS emit per second,\ntrailing edge, so the admin UI still sees the latest status promptly\nwhile a chatty caller can no longer flood the socket. The 5-second\nperiodic full refresh is unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoFeDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmToQAFLSp7e4W77r2zfmVaXrXnLI\nwF476bHtJljF0+l/zFGEYg0wX6RhfiNfwTc9Yc476gTQR3KN4jPu1+eMRXsItr4m\nZTcB/dEBkwlgnoTO4rAz9zVQN8cKdvg58R7Tdf+uC8ClcwCHPMd2vIuI71USCPtw\nePP7bmqOrcXVLZt4seOzhkfi3fMf4AgW/znZpVHpOC1n/coegwLt2r3g78hLp9xk\nsLb8Xch3TzRVjr98L9Mz0Q71QOqLlMseIjN4bKnWyspM9RwXzxna9n4RGNdlTHB3\nWpji2XlmB7ms8JuQdft2S+CjYtIaEohTSG7JjfMl9aQaptzuLzPDbaZg+IkC8qbN\nvCj3JAuhxUDinOFX9jIw2wG3x+SEudwtIluLRcrblnmSNuBT7c8N6OWvIMoRZkAA\ndeOm+BzF1vvKGCb/hiVfSqE1Ew8u3e1sskQuw5JmAVp3M+3caNfdI+ewMbr+u4vG\nB3VhwP6kxCHaabkjP/qyrx717PmF0/htaX+wXLHopLRHQ+eawG1Xt+KgcQdWG32/\niahCEK0gTTcjrkS7ObfM89V8Xn+6g5FZ1m9xnaAkBXgj1QsiMK0K8plHJCcIVLFD\njEbaSGoPjjN0CwcyWZV2ES+xY2c++dtXTUceYu+QJ7pLKJdR5xNIHo4oXLkngSOK\nTJhbSyDB5PV/wQUa446y\n=x/tT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T18:44:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/316751ad464352ec18f68da224c6cc1b58773ad5","node_id":"C_kwDOAUuXCdoAKDMxNjc1MWFkNDY0MzUyZWMxOGY2OGRhMjI0YzZjYzFiNTg3NzNhZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/commit/2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544","sha":"2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544"}],"sha":"316751ad464352ec18f68da224c6cc1b58773ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/316751ad464352ec18f68da224c6cc1b58773ad5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1608058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keesverruijt","id":1608058,"login":"keesverruijt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDgwNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:45:00Z","email":"kees@verruijt.net","name":"Kees Verruijt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:45:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(radar): subscribe to spokes only while displaying the radar (#3019)\n\n* docs(radar): subscribe to spokes only while displaying the radar\n\nA provider treats spoke subscribers as the measure of whether anyone is\nwatching a radar and may let an unwatched one stand down. Spell out that\nclients open the stream only while showing the radar, and that a relaying\nprovider holds its upstream subscription only while it has subscribers of\nits own, using binaryStreamManager.getClientCount.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\n* docs(radar): show the spoke socket being closed, name the stream id\n\n* docs(radar): fix the connection example introduction\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0de72cf07cc2d388bacd4a92561ad6eb8bc7e2c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/0de72cf07cc2d388bacd4a92561ad6eb8bc7e2c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/2bf166bcddbc0d401edbad0350fae629d4b01544","verification":{"payload":"tree 0de72cf07cc2d388bacd4a92561ad6eb8bc7e2c2\nparent 0bfc4b123a4a9327b29a051022cc7924abc9a3ae\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1788828300 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788828300 +0900\n\ndocs(radar): subscribe to spokes only while displaying the radar (#3019)\n\n* docs(radar): subscribe to spokes only while displaying the radar\n\nA provider treats spoke subscribers as the measure of whether anyone is\nwatching a radar and may let an unwatched one stand down. Spell out that\nclients open the stream only while showing the radar, and that a relaying\nprovider holds its upstream subscription only while it has subscribers of\nits own, using binaryStreamManager.getClientCount.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\n* docs(radar): show the spoke socket being closed, name the stream id\n\n* docs(radar): fix the connection example introduction\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <no