om","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add Hat Labs HALPI2 and Halos to hardware options (#2971)\n\nHALPI2 ships with Signal K Server preconfigured, and Halos Marine\nimages include it, so both belong in the lists of ways to obtain a\nrunning server. Also surface those lists from the installation pages,\nwhich previously sent every reader straight into the manual npm\ninstall without mentioning that ready-made options exist.","tree":{"sha":"42c21591d8d4543073f584057d74ac9c00726c49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/42c21591d8d4543073f584057d74ac9c00726c49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/1bf4b72f926bb2cf9dc1fe071b588cb74002fbb3","verification":{"payload":"tree 42c21591d8d4543073f584057d74ac9c00726c49\nparent d39f82a7cd0398f8a309783108629c896bdc4837\nauthor Matti Airas <matti.airas@hatlabs.fi> 1787081987 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787081987 +0300\n\ndocs: add Hat Labs HALPI2 and Halos to hardware options (#2971)\n\nHALPI2 ships with Signal K Server preconfigured, and Halos Marine\nimages include it, so both belong in the lists of ways to obtain a\nrunning server. Also surface those lists from the installation pages,\nwhich previously sent every reader straight into the manual npm\ninstall without mentioning that ready-made options exist.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhLUDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvNYQADEafcYw4cnOnVJf/QYWHPNN\nk4gAMcOYdoR+RgK1RvADlZi+m8hUA9269tQ7M4DMDxzuM77BmcgmRG5eN71PnaiL\nlvxaWKzJDQey4ARckR2cYHRQ8UXpC75WzSGe6ijnEY6/0T2xln75lk1gnHUiykBR\n5I+KXpFfqvHvNZWVE22NdSsfS4JYWbqYLOMv0gsiQfn1lW3RYuqz4Xg5rsXvfEv8\nG/LmT8bHX3RrI4VgkTUgs8Ip5GTGOa5kkVprUmxqpOQyonW7otQ5EH8nc+nbWMNJ\n2/19LWexKgxuEty57luOrY4SSEzn9Yw451BE4HTYUcQ46Ar/LSKY7lp+vxfBNFnr\nOXj5eILz8D8vJF7dvhIrCjNv9scKnFjY6TVZ8P+tfG9SE0DMOmDnRciZoY2ehBxI\n26q9tfzzDRIsPqvGusViWeiRCDxkmNZXKrmY3/s5NPqa8NHCdt8TGQXtfkuRnk15\n3bWCG0YwkY+f3kZIXICBaxkjpGUbPdHxtPd/v4shDiOFrUkZWuUnGecEsO