//api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/86572261450718aaf7a6a8f463df7ba6575d02cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1049678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tkurki","id":1049678,"login":"tkurki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDk2Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/commits/f0aca1d97ae484c4a0a6dec4e44845dc2cdb7e47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:23:16Z","email":"teppo.kurki@iki.fi","name":"Teppo Kurki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:53:38Z","email":"teppo.kurki@iki.fi","name":"Teppo Kurki"},"message":"fix(security): drop deltas with prototype-key context or path\n\nAn authenticated non-admin `readwrite` principal could set arbitrary\nproperties on `Object.prototype` by sending a delta whose context (or\ncontext and path) is `__proto__`, `constructor`, or `prototype`. The\npollution was reachable via two independent paths in `DeltaCache`:\n\n- `getLeafObject` walked `current[p]` per segment; a `__proto__` segment\n  resolves to the live `Object.prototype`, so the next segment was\n  written straight onto the shared prototype.\n- `getContextAndPathParts` cached parts under `cachedContextPaths[context]`;\n  for a `__proto__` context the \"create if missing\" guard never fired and\n  the write landed on `Object.prototype`.\n\nBoth sinks now reject prototype keys using the shared `FORBIDDEN_PATH_KEYS`\nset (moved to `@signalk/server-api` so `fullsignalk.ts` and `deltacache.ts`\nshare one definition). `getLeafObject` returns null on a forbidden segment,\n`getContextAndPathParts` returns the parts uncached and skips the fast-path\nread for a prototype-key context, and the two hot call sites (`onValue`,\n`ingestDelta`) drop the delta when no leaf is produced.\n\nThis is a separate cache tree from the sibling fixes in\n`fullsignalk.ts` (306a64ef) and `applicationData.js`, neither of which\ncovered `DeltaCache`.\n\nRefs: GHSA-q7mc-wh43-5h8x\nhttps://github.com/SignalK/signalk-server/security/advisories/GHSA-q7mc-wh43-5h8x","tree":{"sha":"f4c68ddb48af0469be0f5be05457f762909d5f4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/trees/f4c68ddb48af0469be0f5be05457f762909d5f4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-server/git/commits/f0aca1d97ae484c4a0a6dec4e44845dc2cdb7e47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1049678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tkurki","id":1049678,"login":"tkurki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDk2Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tkurki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com