rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/24701fe02a3fbdeffbe77bd3810a3cdc1ea6a056"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL/commit/721e66f7d92253058b7ccf7637c476c1b218ee21","sha":"721e66f7d92253058b7ccf7637c476c1b218ee21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/721e66f7d92253058b7ccf7637c476c1b218ee21"}],"sha":"a94d62941e99a352e2b47bc4c8117fcc5adf8e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/a94d62941e99a352e2b47bc4c8117fcc5adf8e17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/721e66f7d92253058b7ccf7637c476c1b218ee21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:54:53Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:54:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(me): a used or expired password link no longer offers to confirm again (#471)\n\n* fix(me): a used or expired password link no longer offers to confirm again\n\nThe confirm page asks the API whether the link can still be confirmed\nwhen it loads, and shows the expired message with no button when it\ncan''t. Before, reloading the page after confirming showed Confirm again.\n\nNeeds the API''s PasswordChangeLink query, so the backend is released\nfirst.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(me): a spent password link shows a status and a way home\n\nThe expired message was a line in the confirm card''s header. It is now\nthe shared Status at warning level, titled \"Link expired\", with a link\nto the home page under it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f74f4454d2d4c1baf0ab3126cf07ee1f549aeec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/f74f4454d2d4c1baf0ab3126cf07ee1f549aeec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/721e66f7d92253058b7ccf7637c476c1b218ee21","verification":{"payload":"tree f74f4454d2d4c1baf0ab3126cf07ee1f549aeec5\nparent 17383d939d6ae3fd89f8fa4d10812eb4f2c6eea5\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791269693 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791269693 -0700\n\nfix(me): a used or expired password link no longer offers to confirm again (#471)\n\n* fix(me): a used or expired password link no longer offers to confirm again\n\nThe confirm page asks the API whether the link can still be confirmed\nwhen it loads, and shows the expired message with no button when it\ncan''t. Before, reloading the page after confirming showed Confirm again.\n\nNeeds the API''s PasswordChangeLink query, so the backend is released\nfirst.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(me): a spent password link shows a status and a way home\n\nThe expired message was a line in the confirm card''s header. It is now\nthe shared Status at warning level, titled \"Link expired\", with a link\nto the home page under it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxJs9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZXEQACGufEq3vz1MJwLgftoyg2Hl\nYlAggsTYSC/oiwvRprMAf8uEi0NEuvmB5p0CTgya+OhdTd1HpBuKWbCSWp5CD0Wf\n8Co5OBHnwnJaYqoeDg3DaI0KDmySQuLhvFtx6sRaYikgBpMHmZbFVXftoGXM7dXE\nq2ZnsKTKPf2lRNcnAvlYV8RLumTwvMSHaVVT2oKpOYFzLDkoGK/ByK+RxeNsNce/\nE126t0eKipIVvR/rTY0l9lWEKP5SnVmrB7kOLiq6w5F3SQcTFHtm9jqGhXvlfGRz\n/UGQlNkwnhZhsABuMeYn2ScvEnP8haiYZ/Cwc0AxbgADgaE2OX4/ZThpqIrJaJur\n6FeYTvJrbiG8e544DbrOaBXw/Iv/JzxukcfdX1Jcdx4Wfkz5nuYywinSdoQ28Cvk\n4bIliIYFaoHlPu0u9sqLH4uOtJ2oCix4Im2Nqynpk3GdHWIcujEfLhMxySFdgyK8\nSusBUdW2H/tv9N8mOGNHKEwa9DjOX5uuhu+pGn49dxVj18OGyhfP7lLgfrA57nln\neTwcTGOb0zqsQJdHPzx7Iop1XywWUoT56rvc4u1T3bb2iDfYn8DMYB9BzIc5bLY6\nJQ4bju+sIDAnKqrEa43hrtXv72hfqjC9DlQmn+4AUsWjAqKMhViXt3m0m1Mgm8/C\n8X6B4rzU4IBE+QqVSnPf\n=4SSP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T06:54:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repo