github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/17383d939d6ae3fd89f8fa4d10812eb4f2c6eea5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:22:15Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:22:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(account): one sign-out dialog, and a mobile menu that stays at the top as it closes (#469)\n\n* docs(tree-of-life): the article no longer says requests are rate limited\n\nThe API''s per-session request limit is being removed, so the sentence\nwould be wrong. The plate quotas the article describes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(account): one sign-out dialog beside the navigation, cards sized to their content\n\nThe sign-out dialog was rendered by each account menu. On mobile that put\nit inside the navigation dialog, where it can only show while the menu is\nopen. Navigation now renders it once, next to whichever menu is in use.\n\nThe profile, password and portfolio sign-in cards take their content''s\nwidth instead of a fixed one. The sign-out message and the experiments\n\"more\" message are centred.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(navigation): the mobile menu opens from the top and stays there as it closes\n\nThe menu dialog opens from zero height and no longer slides down the\nscreen on exit. This needs the design system''s dialog to read\n--kicl--components--dialog--translate--starting-style when closed.\n\nIts padding is one step smaller, the experiment links animate at the\ndefault speed, and the account rows come in after them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bb09328bb62456cca45ed0723f68ae33cbf73ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/6bb09328bb62456cca45ed0723f68ae33cbf73ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/17383d939d6ae3fd89f8fa4d10812eb4f2c6eea5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bb09328bb62456cca45ed0723f68ae33cbf73ca\nparent 8235e5b7f3b582026ae1eab70b6b35e443070356\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791267735 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791267735 -0700\n\nfix(account): one sign-out dialog, and a mobile menu that stays at the top as it closes (#469)\n\n* docs(tree-of-life): the article no longer says requests are rate limited\n\nThe API''s per-session request limit is being removed, so the sentence\nwould be wrong. The plate quotas the article describes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(account): one sign-out dialog beside the navigation, cards sized to their content\n\nThe sign-out dialog was rendered by each account menu. On mobile that put\nit inside the navigation dialog, where it can only show while the menu is\nopen. Navigation now renders it once, next to whichever menu is in use.\n\nThe profile, password and portfolio sign-in cards take their content''s\nwidth instead of a fixed one. The sign-out message and the experiments\n\"more\" message are centred.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(navigation): the mobile menu opens from the top and stays there as it closes\n\nThe menu dialog opens from zero height and no longer slides down the\nscreen on exit. This needs the design system''s dialog to read\n--kicl--components--dialog--translate--starting-style when closed.\n\nIts padding is one step smaller, the experiment links animate at the\ndefault speed, and the account rows come in after them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxJOXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsXwQAB8wg4z1gb9QV09uwvkuUjdm\nEOXmbUhryPvGrax3o/ff9Yq0Gd65bBG638HTHvYOR4oBv/WDH/XNq7o+5g5aNYWj\nEC+1Vo5217KE67sljRRVu+g7CZtC4NZy4qIsfoEvLpU65lhdKHPn3xB+wuQFOSDX\nY6mrqYURbz/Jo19xIDFLzUTOEiR4WbTryrxw0PKAFH6mkZAZSJqFkTE6aYTwdawY\nmkLvaVKsnZRif0D/luTbDW1+vfUJ2mXaEhl74o5Xv4/3hA4oTOdtX6tyoiFtpwJI\ntcTaRfUWp1W4mG0bDUmZVhmhrjJeCC3ssCiq7AfBK4pqx7Y4drAHsoqGaNZ8+0IN\n7YyDjRlkFT53xv0kMhEbQZzmg2Nho3Ppe9aIl3CASfmz+9/dp6N2OHZCSlOWpSXX\nIQ9NkiQub0zlxw0DZJbaWG9haS0GgpkPWrLLmcGOBEkaF4taYn5ZjK7Og/F9TwxJ\njDnSt7IT54L8cC0V3Ac7TqYySoBsLC73Om4pO/aU8OEMtZnL2Ccy55skjVdw0IQ8\nYHt/AgLQR9GQMqAmoeLqJktwsa03qe4xod8R34kx44vFZjMmIrk5uP7iugjK8/hE\nuPxv3GLIQmHFmEGVIiEmiSautXV5obxb4dF4DdMlY+JRm5SsRj8o5DKr9bD5Z6Tm\ndsZHCeihK2B/gRjRaJBw\n=XKmz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T06:22:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://ap