/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/8235e5b7f3b582026ae1eab70b6b35e443070356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:26:24Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:26:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(me): the home background and frame behind the profile and sign-in pages (#467)\n\nThe profile, password and sign-in pages sit in a Frame over the home\npage''s background, with see-through cards. The background now comes from\ndesign/widgets, so the copy in views/home is gone. Card headers and\nactions are centred; form labels stay left.\n\nThe frame grows with its content and the section takes the frame''s inset,\nso a window shorter than the card scrolls without clipping it.\n\nThe portfolio wrapper takes the page''s width. main centres its children,\nso the wrapper shrank to its content and a frame inside it collapsed.\n\nThe delete dialog says what goes with the account: the portfolio pieces\nthe user can open and their image agent conversations, or one general\nline when it knows of neither.\n\nA failed or expired password change offers only Start again. Go back is\nstill above it, so Back to my profile said the same thing twice.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ce0e6e0c376386bb921d8bf9332c6ad651cec19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/4ce0e6e0c376386bb921d8bf9332c6ad651cec19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/8235e5b7f3b582026ae1eab70b6b35e443070356","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ce0e6e0c376386bb921d8bf9332c6ad651cec19\nparent 1e3a042120675e68c4ee591113aa48a6a00bfcb1\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791249984 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791249984 -0700\n\nfeat(me): the home background and frame behind the profile and sign-in pages (#467)\n\nThe profile, password and sign-in pages sit in a Frame over the home\npage''s background, with see-through cards. The background now comes from\ndesign/widgets, so the copy in views/home is gone. Card headers and\nactions are centred; form labels stay left.\n\nThe frame grows with its content and the section takes the frame''s inset,\nso a window shorter than the card scrolls without clipping it.\n\nThe portfolio wrapper takes the page''s width. main centres its children,\nso the wrapper shrank to its content and a frame inside it collapsed.\n\nThe delete dialog says what goes with the account: the portfolio pieces\nthe user can open and their image agent conversations, or one general\nline when it knows of neither.\n\nA failed or expired password change offers only Start again. Go back is\nstill above it, so Back to my profile said the same thing twice.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxE5ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK4oQACEE/DZWxvA0Il8Ookt1Vod0\nGQvSkMf1BEFORaMY7WYJ3yxKnnoQi79IQPZoa/HdDySjg0h7tm7gTfGJP4tjKA7/\n2XVuxHRU4MDGFqadMp0KXf+HkN358YcCTqCG9qZxtw+Qi/UchTG04Sqd2gQBY2X+\nnSoFgpyvpFhqwrf5YkqwMLVGhJp42nv+U2qfraNCoWWPeFOwPczaKblxztEMtHK6\n3RxQWWfF+18Fza2CStpE/uB/m5HYOIVM0li24Zc7KAhk2IEQxvgTVXHa5vdfVhkp\n8v6aMqL9utsZhjTHvLrlcS8g2S/Wr6jOoJrNNJSHFyE3D0pxueYwwSULoNXxLpvK\nNzGsRgnFTJ0vsmlY7NFhQh1ogs9u+Pr8fnyRQJOfBVRwvf6Ka9A311tUIKOxEu