essage":"feat(gcp): make gcp.analytics reads the site''s analytics from the logs (#463)\n\nThe site writes each analytics event as a log line, and reading them\nmeant typing a gcloud filter by hand. make gcp.analytics prints page\nviews from the last day, and TYPE, SINCE, LIMIT and REGION narrow it.\n\ngcp.analytics.source and gcp.analytics.second do the same for one\nproduction region. They take the region names from gcp/.env, so the\nnames stay out of git.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a3fc9dd53a3a789136061493f6e8e367f7a5a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/8a3fc9dd53a3a789136061493f6e8e367f7a5a84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/a90fb36954a6e0dcb6829b08cd4bc3a50defe675","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a3fc9dd53a3a789136061493f6e8e367f7a5a84\nparent 964ff2ab1536e222dc4126154ac9c3839fa2db9a\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791233516 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791233516 -0700\n\nfeat(gcp): make gcp.analytics reads the site''s analytics from the logs (#463)\n\nThe site writes each analytics event as a log line, and reading them\nmeant typing a gcloud filter by hand. make gcp.analytics prints page\nviews from the last day, and TYPE, SINCE, LIMIT and REGION narrow it.\n\ngcp.analytics.source and gcp.analytics.second do the same for one\nproduction region. They take the region names from gcp/.env, so the\nnames stay out of git.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxA3sCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApeAQAGpqsMm61US5rvtog1LCTy89\nBVMzJr5bp5bXTNkMsBFJUadt/5F7oIFilzCJPJFsHMb6zyx7zi5pPMhhS1Qngg+U\n2QQX4D++tlAcq0VI2ktZfSv7vEc/AlxCsyO+krOLtXWMDNTqcKVgt75JYndvfKYF\n9huSMHVpcPI7RETQiPH/QdJw8FMQL6I9zO1SxlR0PR+/8+sZGzkfKGK+EcTVqyFQ\nIx2v0LolFvgl+0+NQ56Kqxh+XmRMdfKvZnwG/HJlVS/CHIRkvTPCeynDdJWansb2\nk5flL+srMHiXG9fFjtt7NjbhjXO/o778d8ASz4mGzVFc0G3F/KnEM