":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/19fad2195e1818527083c67d077ca2b2f2e946e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:19:50Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:19:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: load components, styles and icons from the design system remote (#444)\n\nComponents, core styles, icons, widgets, the theme/responsive/resize\nhooks and the HTTP status pages now come from Ki.CL-design-system, loaded\nas the federated remote `design`. The folders are deleted here, and views\nimport from design/components, design/hooks, design/icons, design/status\nand design/widgets.\n\nThe remote is proxied same-origin at /design, like the API: Vite proxies\nto KICL_DESIGN_URL in development (default http://localhost:3200), and\nthe Express proxy forwards it in production with an ID token for that\nservice. react-router-dom and react-hook-form are shared singletons,\nbecause the remote reads the router and form context views create.\n\nThe remote doesn''t expose the react-icons sets, so views import them from\nreact-icons directly. Every host stylesheet is now a view, so the layer\nhelper only places files in `views`; the other layers come from the\nremote''s stylesheet. Unused dependencies and helpers go with the move.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7967228387ce0cd08da2c81b8e51284fa8413b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/7967228387ce0cd08da2c81b8e51284fa8413b57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/19fad2195e1818527083c67d077ca2b2f2e946e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 7967228387ce0cd08da2c81b8e51284fa8413b57\nparent 45b8b86478d42e595ecffefc61e54c391fe8ee05\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791069590 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791069590 -0700\n\nfeat: load components, styles and icons from the design system remote (#444)\n\nComponents, core styles, icons, widgets, the theme/responsive/resize\nhooks and the HTTP status pages now come from Ki.CL-design-system, loaded\nas the federated remote `design`. The folders are deleted here, and views\nimport from design/components, design/hooks, design/icons, design/status\nand design/widgets.\n\nThe remote is proxied same-origin at /design, like the API: Vite proxies\nto KICL_DESIGN_URL in development (default http://localhost:3200), and\nthe Express proxy forwards it in production with an ID token for that\nservice. react-router-dom and react-hook-form are shared singletons,\nbecause the remote reads the router and form context views create.\n\nThe remote doesn''t expose the react-icons sets, so views import them from\nreact-icons directly. Every host stylesheet is now a view, so the layer\nhelper only places files in `views`; the other layers come from the\nremote''s stylesheet. Unused dependencies and helpers go with the move.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <hello@ki-cl.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwY2WCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr3cQABBVwOlTfg+mD8oKw4rcptUK\nhKW6elGTjTuo/P060aDsYPFJT6HkDYrAUmRbkTRMLTTT2iv7Frj4EUxQyODGENIG\nN12/XRuI7Vyr4KbRTt/9AfoGH+0iSdP/RgBZYFexpVxkZ0Ky0KlMf7fmSyvsv4zX\nentzkQUTO7wH1uRqhdR6FB06ci3x2Q/BkPUB4P2ntFkBGdcRkzT3X8+gq0hq6u4n\n357SRk2eYFhoUJdMSERCXfDatwPWho7BdNRgC1m0itgWm1TRr7/w/EGEMBxpIBj+\nJe5QGKiLvWAm9hUWxg14IleKLSxqmDUBS4vT3jAje7ipBSGl+4P3D38nKFc2dDB/\nPgl8iYByr82pkrKOgZ5UGu12Wqg0tCJMgG/iTFStz9noBUcv0u/L1qyrZAko1M1b\nrQcTmHZ1nXt3pIjeO2uYHoUsfrdx4z/r09DqY23iHz2X+x/gwR9h2byLg1uUsPGy\nLODRxB/5rnpTH/APEff3UYPWAi4Yi7OpkFgD+s5T7lbaWAhmghTb/IHUeucpQXtQ\nA9oo+dJQwKwFiDbewXoxtxFjO