lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/9569cae3f05e4071094722e282ee7b1e5b74f173/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:48:38Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:48:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(components): shared components on Layout grids, and a dev port freed before make run (#441)\n\nCard, Bubble, Input group and Popover lay themselves out with Layout grids\ninstead of their own flex rules, and Card''s `tone` is now `level`, the\nsame word Button and Badge use. Card gets a sticky footer and a `dense`\noption; Spinner, Sheet, Checkbox, Separator, the Details marker and the\nanimations drop rules the shared utilities now cover. The views that\nused the old props follow.\n\nmake run stops whatever already listens on the dev port from .env\n(scripts/free-port.sh), usually a dev server left running from last time.\n\nThese came out of the robotic-arm work but are not about it, so they land\non develop on their own.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1dfdaa27ce222da3f1249702f24bc8a76373046a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/1dfdaa27ce222da3f1249702f24bc8a76373046a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/9569cae3f05e4071094722e282ee7b1e5b74f173","verification":{"payload":"tree 1dfdaa27ce222da3f1249702f24bc8a76373046a\nparent d365ba56d7aec4e36b03a5459dd8295d6e033183\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1791064118 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791064118 -0700\n\nrefactor(components): shared components on Layout grids, and a dev port freed before make run (#441)\n\nCard, Bubble, Input group and Popover lay themselves out with Layout grids\ninstead of their own flex rules, and Card''s `tone` is now `level`, the\nsame word Button and Badge use. Card gets a sticky footer and a `dense`\noption; Spinner, Sheet, Checkbox, Separator, the Details marker and the\nanimations drop rules the shared utilities now cover. The views that\nused the old props follow.\n\nmake run stops whatever already listens on the dev port from .env\n(scripts/free-port.sh), usually a dev server left running from last time.\n\nThese came out of the robotic-arm work but are not about it, so they land\non develop on their own.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwXg2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3xQQACEKfCWn1TuEjHEzDHy4lWiu\noro0DpM5YeaT0BCIY+EmBd+Y9RGjwUf37h6KRnxQoo8dKRVJ80KeXzy5YiOtnVp3\njZ86ZXuFYua42BHCzb2PZsdR/H3BcOMiSM5AFZbKxH1hBZehbo6LDROTbZdurFWc\nrs45gsIl/DSgG68LAmmhay4OSrM6vqWF2q7TgGhbDXm890SQbqe641cUWG03JJhp\nnnPzlkdYh3xgz0MPfvz/Mp1EKvtjKn0f+u5u1v4Dmk6b8aMexmS7ZUmMVyeEYiZP\nsgt8g9Dv9iXQHbsWfLBVRG1xxOcyqzx+u1bJZMggrMVfYV8lqtbmiDVkvcEFy99y\nqkrceASC0VyI+lITYRKKd+jNd0DyXxC0XjELz6jmTYaWzqOufaqkzYMYGVR7JDbq\nn0E7g2iUPp/3S7vLe4JErahBMjgqBWUepfz1UO2zD5JsC1XZ499wv8PdQEHP+tCu\n7g1+hI6Cz20aMfqLsi7vEyqbutouVrnsFhqq7j0IMiQDW/YJRKlTaNi6Jcb3Dvm0\n7iRYj8K4DgxnVO7b2G0FK/KSDfjaLO20vLoXVIj32rBOb8OC1vM5gTEHfW1WFiPL\nWHLHuygBFFqSv43MA2yPeKUhrDKBWiktH5NRStUpHXjkeI9p+wxZNkWjrM4lE//V\neGqPd2Dmnogv1QdZKKNA\n=Drsq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T21:48:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user