":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/65d520e545daa56b3405e22545eeb114b05b5224/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:10:38Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:10:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(server): show a page when someone cancels the password prompt (#438)\n\n* feat(server): show a page when someone cancels the password prompt\n\nThe gate used to answer a 401 with an empty body, so cancelling the prompt\nleft a blank screen. It now sends a small page with a \"Try again\" button\nthat reloads and brings the prompt back.\n\nThe image is inlined as base64 at startup. The gate blocks every other\nrequest, so a separate image URL would get a 401 too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(server): the 401 page uses the site''s type and Button\n\nThe heading, text and button were styled by hand and did not look like the\nrest of the site. They now use the values from the site''s tokens: the body\nfont at weight 300 with its letter-spacing, the small uppercase eyebrow,\nthe heading at the extreme size, and the small primary Button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b0afb3cfaf6ef2e1880bd22239e4f268e45d33c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/5b0afb3cfaf6ef2e1880bd22239e4f268e45d33c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/65d520e545daa56b3405e22545eeb114b05b5224","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b0afb3cfaf6ef2e1880bd22239e4f268e45d33c\nparent c6b6b3927ef2858d8bc186bb5764b8a3a4bb542d\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790791838 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790791838 -0700\n\nfeat(server): show a page when someone cancels the password prompt (#438)\n\n* feat(server): show a page when someone cancels the password prompt\n\nThe gate used to answer a 401 with an empty body, so cancelling the prompt\nleft a blank screen. It now sends a small page with a \"Try again\" button\nthat reloads and brings the prompt back.\n\nThe image is inlined as base64 at startup. The gate blocks every other\nrequest, so a separate image URL would get a 401 too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(server): the 401 page uses the site''s type and Button\n\nThe heading, text and button were styled by hand and did not look like the\nrest of the site. They now use the values from the site''s tokens: the body\nfont at weight 300 with its letter-spacing, the small uppercase eyebrow,\nthe heading at the extreme size, and the small primary Button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvVCeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABp8QAIS0Ryhk/SeEb9OOQ17y7wxr\ns5+CfcW7CjNXsODC759sQW4esaf/MobD+r38YmGVdAdj7XQMnjYHUgvXHyWWTW5q\nh+r8ZQAWcDsfWg1f1MuKuwEaYASFMiyV6pAXC4nYr5gfXh7TM8NFuRK0krNaOjr/\nVT+VgRaij2+ZqC85za5QLVKbsmlyfxaymr9n