ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/e43d179eabfa7cb3b08ec97ff740e062a6caf00c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:57:08Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:57:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): take the security fixes from ten open Dependabot PRs (#409)\n\nDependabot opened these between June 2025 and February 2026, and each\none still applied: develop was on the vulnerable version. One update\ninstead of ten rebases.\n\n- glob 11.0.2 -> 11.1.0 and express 5.1.0 -> 5.2.1, both pinned in\n  App/.client and App/.server.\n- axios, body-parser, brace-expansion, diff, qs, tar and undici moved to\n  the newest versions their dependents allow, all past the fixes.\n- lodash: commitizen pins 4.17.21 exactly, so a resolution moves that\n  copy to 4.17.23. commitizen only runs when committing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9228f77309de0cef7b93b215c8554ba7569b0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/d9228f77309de0cef7b93b215c8554ba7569b0a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/e43d179eabfa7cb3b08ec97ff740e062a6caf00c","verification":{"payload":"tree d9228f77309de0cef7b93b215c8554ba7569b0a0\nparent 0a0bdec7ca923bfa86c49d71f0cd46121dfc20c5\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790463428 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790463428 -0700\n\nchore(deps): take the security fixes from ten open Dependabot PRs (#409)\n\nDependabot opened these between June 2025 and February 2026, and each\none still applied: develop was on the vulnerable version. One update\ninstead of ten rebases.\n\n- glob 11.0.2 -> 11.1.0 and express 5.1.0 -> 5.2.1, both pinned in\n  App/.client and App/.server.\n- axios, body-parser, brace-expansion, diff, qs, tar and undici moved to\n  the newest versions their dependents allow, all past the fixes.\n- lodash: commitizen pins 4.17.21 exactly, so a resolution moves that\n  copy to 4.17.23. commitizen only runs when committing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquE3ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuoAQACEEAVLley+hfy2zn9Ti16sJ\nW39NRq9Pl00ysl76f6lt6TM4iiDF4/lO5TgSh/jV6BUvMJ8bGAupbYi7we8gfL4x\n0oEQIvHCUFl1n/zOM8VwEQGpY+2JNcns76jyLLY/IMZfQ1pXv3Py8QO7dqtADwiZ\n+CkF2U4tyCrEjkah/Z8lJSzF7u8wHDkK1LEwIVfebLGT38tY8mIxLTk6eVVJLXNg\n7cMrLCdEZ7xPmZXCQGiGyC8wsKlJx6ZxmryD3nJoGiJmyuPUwlgS0n+SMCJqGYDt\nNYWbuuskL1phRdGZg9uibGl3NmDoloFboNhazTdKe2MyRNXFh2GKiK/SgDNYEMjs\nssLCNCrXIuA5BDLPNqWlnqMxE8QVxNtp+12XIa5kzRjHNTNEtAPhIomr1NYeaYfe\nlf83diHfWepPsyB7P3KKqx0+sNlHIlStnY3fzjqo2Jqk6FQPn1J+rTBc57QfM4B6\nINk3bH9bNXANkO58QeKpsLd9QMJpglTIqayVcoifh4Lxr1tMkUBE4ggH2cPGTinD\nF+qhB7A1UrpZEFa7+OM7AF7q9bgdT8b/cQLwx+G7uNt09Qf6aYjAv0kd45Mzc7Pv\nWu+j7etn2CyXUolDvB3QCpb85t0+nL6y4BXsIG/WjvmK9mx8GhI8mGr1Le6TIa7z\njukeGIc