ithub.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/0a0bdec7ca923bfa86c49d71f0cd46121dfc20c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:49:52Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:49:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tsconfig): set rootDir on the .client and .server configs (#424)\n\nBoth files only extend App/tsconfig.json, but TypeScript 6 defaults\nrootDir to the config''s own folder when outDir is set. The IDE picks the\nnearest config, so every import that reaches outside .client or .server,\nsuch as `../.server/collect` from the Vite config, reported TS6059. With\nrootDir at App, the folder that actually holds the sources, tsc passes\nagainst both configs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a78d94739855852778e8da2df93366154114686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/7a78d94739855852778e8da2df93366154114686"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/0a0bdec7ca923bfa86c49d71f0cd46121dfc20c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a78d94739855852778e8da2df93366154114686\nparent dc2477d5d2ca23241b7e771191669e82bbad6d21\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790462992 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790462992 -0700\n\nfix(tsconfig): set rootDir on the .client and .server configs (#424)\n\nBoth files only extend App/tsconfig.json, but TypeScript 6 defaults\nrootDir to the config''s own folder when outDir is set. The IDE picks the\nnearest config, so every import that reaches outside .client or .server,\nsuch as `../.server/collect` from the Vite config, reported TS6059. With\nrootDir at App, the folder that actually holds the sources, tsc passes\nagainst both configs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquEwQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABJMQACjjTcTjbhSBGjNRIH9b4iu6\nBEXTTmguDxqu/KqUTfgsS4SHQh4JEzywc5BJr96ZSKnGq6hYP6mKJmDxro+oWc1f\ndS4QvGnySffkbJ4fa1THqmrb7k3NUIgyyftStH3lQhV2YBNoydTor/62Msh8CvxQ\nX3tpI5hpLmBhK8d5uHCKQzYNnyJbDhgLgSSm3SPk88ZXdsxcmu6HMLZWKM0s2wes\nX1+NKk1uuAla/PYYe9JelL0xun384xI88Jpf1knXBUjawek4+u15bDdHV0LkHWY/\nENBJbcW7c1Lz7O3AlaWPF2RhFXiRXyxvnj03bQrh4BBRiVbxvq6HDhA1CtBxM6Ka\njYrjIkY+PLoLW6gEQ9rmy7nUE4tSsx1/3Oth+eE8jhPLLFHwprVPq1yna0JT4GbZ\nahf0JFYjoklZvsPO3aRCn/GTWf1otiUs2L4i3kGbHA9xU22hq7R8rlFzJd6JOAyB\n5zVk83F9s0G36CxTCRrz23vfwczTSANlvbSGRAswQhbyQ0+x/V9OiBz8WpO4z7h7\npKjgePLM5JL3Rg5FOx8k77gq7388Y+MkBFL9SYUNz8TvYbPyTM5opFSu0nzJWfwo\nC4QSf8cW2aUvLo3PoEV2kO/No330WGDblZeSNMq0x0qK1+oxTezr77N5kGSwmD+j\np054g7b113Qf2vemp42J\n=bZTS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T22:49:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_use