09-26T05:23:09Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:23:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(session): start a session on every page, and re-run Turnstile when asked (#411)\n\nThe API now counts everything per session and no longer reads the\nvisitor''s address. The Session gate moves from the two experiment routes\nto the root route, and the proxy stops sending x-kicl-client-address.\nvisitorAddress stays in the analytics module, which hashes it for the\ndaily visitor id.\n\nA paid request refused with CAPTCHA_REQUIRED runs the check in a dialog\nover the page and is sent once more, so the composer keeps its text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86c6de1a0d7982fae082b99e3d965cf336b03935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/86c6de1a0d7982fae082b99e3d965cf336b03935"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/5793491f71472604ee7c7f112d66bf80e2697d36","verification":{"payload":"tree 86c6de1a0d7982fae082b99e3d965cf336b03935\nparent cd524928f28ad14d30dbe332756f38be0e729c85\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790400189 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790400189 -0700\n\nfeat(session): start a session on every page, and re-run Turnstile when asked (#411)\n\nThe API now counts everything per session and no longer reads the\nvisitor''s address. The Session gate moves from the two experiment routes\nto the root route, and the proxy stops sending x-kicl-client-address.\nvisitorAddress stays in the analytics module, which hashes it for the\ndaily visitor id.\n\nA paid request refused with CAPTCHA_REQUIRED runs the check in a dialog\nover the page and is sent once more, so the composer keeps its text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","