m@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:36:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(image-agent): say when the API is rate limiting, not \"Connection problem\" (#397)\n\nThe conversation showed \"Connection problem\" for every error, including\na 429 from the API''s request limit. It now shows \"Slow down\" when the\nerror''s code is TOO_MANY_REQUESTS.\n\nA new GetErrorCode helper reads the first extensions.code from an Apollo\nerror, and the session gate uses it too instead of its own copy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfb341da34bfa307cd5baad774cca052f59825b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/bfb341da34bfa307cd5baad774cca052f59825b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/799226925e3703b5c42fb9f5cbf08660f862e6a2","verification":{"payload":"tree bfb341da34bfa307cd5baad774cca052f59825b3\nparent 46bc73e906e4ebd0c296060ac0bbdb2ca01c494a\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790318186 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790318186 -0700\n\nfix(image-agent): say when the API is rate limiting, not \"Connection problem\" (#397)\n\nThe conversation showed \"Connection problem\" for every error, including\na 429 from the API''s request limit. It now shows \"Slow down\" when the\nerror''s code is TOO_MANY_REQUESTS.\n\nA new GetErrorCode helper reads the first extensions.code from an Apollo\nerror, and the session gate uses it too instead of its own copy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqthZqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsGcQAGwi8vpoxgVaD94W3mg5ObMK\nWn8isRWgrNAwChLJbvJi2ORZcR545LANexJAO7JpKO+hIF8PivP5DSQ1tmZM1WMt\nYOrEmUXgG6gdqDc2vOg7mUBKAqAipLAJlYIRylhVjk0kK3yEQIXZTomndTy5rrnH\n8zNDM3FUY/ffRax7+