_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/3e68fa628cc76594cacd0d72f356c28e0efff631/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:25:41Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:29:38Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"message":"refactor(experiments): one 12-column inset on Frame, and a simpler image agent start\n\nThe home view, the tree-of-life banner, the page dots and the global header\neach worked out their own inset to line up with a centred 12-column page.\nFrame now has two shared values for it, --columns-inset for an element as\nwide as the frame and --page-inset for one as wide as the window, plus a\nkicl-padding-inline-frame-columns-12 utility.\n\nThe image agent start page loses the Welcome and More parts. \"How it works\"\nmoves into the article as a Details section. Composer takes a disallow prop\ninstead of the page choosing between it and a standalone Allowance, and the\ndense variant is gone. The chat''s grid rows use Layout''s frames prop instead\nof view SCSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7046834b478972d4e4f94e0a34a7c9cc31beb00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/7046834b478972d4e4f94e0a34a7c9cc31beb00c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/3e68fa628cc76594cacd0d72f356c28e0efff631","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent