/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/fae645c3d0cada5ab49b60cc8174eecfcc2f61b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:33:44Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:33:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(global-header): theme toggle, and experiments in the mobile menu (#378)\n\n* fix(experiments): scrim only the image agent plate\n\nThe other plates have no photo behind the text, and the scrim darkened\nthem too much.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dialog): start full-screen content at the top\n\nA full-screen dialog is taller than its content, and the grid shared the\nspare height between the rows. The header row took half of it, so the\nmobile navigation opened in the middle of the screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(global-header): dark and light theme toggle\n\nThe theme follows the system until the person picks one. The pick is kept\nin a kicl-theme cookie rather than local storage, so a server can render\nin it later. The toggle sits after the nav, and before the menu button on\nmobile so the menu button stays at the end.\n\nThe header is a flex row now: with a third item, space-between put the nav\nin the middle. The logo, menu icon and gaps are smaller.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(navigation): list each experiment in the mobile menu\n\nThe experiments come from the same list as the experiments page. They\nslide in after the Experiments link has finished.\n\nThe stagger moved from a JS index to sibling-index() in CSS. Browsers\nwithout it bring the items in together. Items travel less than the gap\nbetween them: the old 50% was of the item''s height, and the Experiments\nitem, now holding a list, slid over Home. The menu is right-aligned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0c41399272199d14b7cd50001d89d53746812d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/f0c41399272199d14b7cd50001d89d53746812d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/fae645c3d0cada5ab49b60cc8174eecfcc2f61b0","verification":{"payload":"tree f0c41399272199d14b7cd50001d89d53746812d7\nparent c8b0d0fa05be4fa174be7e1958f449948c16a1c0\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790278424 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790278424 -0700\n\nfeat(global-header): theme toggle, and experiments in the mobile menu (#378)\n\n* fix(experiments): scrim only the image agent plate\n\nThe other plates have no photo behind the text, and the scrim darkened\nthem too much.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dialog): start full-screen content at the top\n\nA full-screen dialog is taller than its content, and the grid shared the\nspare height between the rows. The header row took half of it, so the\nmobile navigation opened in the middle of the screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(global-header): dark and light theme toggle\n\nThe theme follows the system until the person picks one. The pick is kept\nin a kicl-theme cookie rather than local storage, so a server can render\nin it later. The toggle sits after the nav, and before the menu button on\nmobile so the menu button stays at the end.\n\nThe header is a flex row now: with a third item, space-between put the nav\nin the middle. The logo, menu icon and gaps are smaller.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(navigation): list each experiment in the mobile menu\n\nThe experiments come from the same list as the experiments page. They\nslide in after the Experiments link has finished.\n\nThe stagger moved from a JS index to sibling-index() in CSS. Browsers\nwithout it bring the items in together. Items travel less than the gap\nbetween them: the old 50% was of the item''s height, and the Experiments\nitem, now holding a list, slid over Home. The menu is right-aligned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtXsYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcw4QAImx4VGSfsaRWMEmKLuVB5ts\nz4rNKvwgKV1qdsGpP4TJX4NMJ3pl7/FDerg3bdwj3Vp/YQPVN494fMo5BV4izA1b\nVeWitHWzjNDQ0koIvAPZ8lMIhRWrpmOWWArtbcqiteThmiR3wYFR97AkOBZFkQzC\n8vTfhUJWhC43bvh2CkuQ0ZSD2QTLB9VdSYD0Sfzv9GIfbaPoB7IFBWteYEy7d3uc\nZ3gkPl6UiH2ULCKaccPu7O8PmRRBGQG2QhervIz2fH9Qs4ao3mNH5U0vUTs18zyo\nbLL3eETVMX8PmmiuE/HvRrW5BzGTgT87t/4zhHP09oB/iritwstBXVKdMblZtWYa\nTqk/PzGsNNd5SrJyWtNy/r25WxpodxmXLsZshZsiAEP9D8e99TKRRN1xPq0X6i8S\nP79fq52YNAMIi5nQT9857A70h+iOhbbG0sqkZEIbfE6Q9fLrkzZ8rKmvZh1XEgOH\nCX1KV6sKenI4EEfQNjpELXwZt4Uk0mbhgp8EuVO1ElHazua74JIXfIq6lTVwU7n3\nnVHLZgdZPmppWV1kNGaxCf5uQtEtbUxPgngdhncUuQ8tyHap8pseek8kt/tCG3p8\nu7z0y80hOikw17Pgv716OljLg27Sp+aVB4cq3aUFurFhNKsZq5tbKx7X2tNhLAfp\nNnDnW78OJ+2afpL7xKS3\n=lgGG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at