node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/c8b0d0fa05be4fa174be7e1958f449948c16a1c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:33:12Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:33:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: stop iOS field zoom and refetch the chat thread when the page returns (#376)\n\niOS Safari zooms the page into any input, select or textarea set below 16px\nwhen it takes focus, and our fields use kicl-font-size-small (0.8rem). Fields\nare now at least 16px on iOS only, detected with -webkit-touch-callout, so\nother browsers keep the smaller size.\n\nThe image agent chat could stay on its last step until a hard refresh. A\nreply published while the socket is down never arrives, because graphql-ws\nreconnects without replaying missed updates. The thread is now fetched again\nwhen the page becomes visible or the device comes back online.\n\nAlso updates CLAUDE.md, UPGRADES.md and the path alias rule to the typed\ndocument pattern. The Backend stopped generating useKicl_* hooks in afc8245,\nand the docs still showed them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4576fe3542894bfd535acd61ea13fa8b6a5ecba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/4576fe3542894bfd535acd61ea13fa8b6a5ecba2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/c8b0d0fa05be4fa174be7e1958f449948c16a1c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 4576fe3542894bfd535acd61ea13fa8b6a5ecba2\nparent 2e4f4b3e7a8257766a180ef0508cda21815d5142\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790278392 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790278392 -0700\n\nfix: stop iOS field zoom and refetch the chat thread when the page returns (#376)\n\niOS Safari zooms the page into any input, select or textarea set below 16px\nwhen it takes focus, and our fields use kicl-font-size-small (0.8rem). Fields\nare now at least 16px on iOS only, detected with -webkit-touch-callout, so\nother browsers keep the smaller size.\n\nThe image agent chat could stay on its last step until a hard refresh. A\nreply published while the socket is down never arrives, because graphql-ws\nreconnects without replaying missed updates. The thread is now fetched again\nwhen the page becomes visible or the device comes back online.\n\nAlso updates CLAUDE.md, UPGRADES.md and the path alias rule to the typed\ndocument pattern. The Backend stopped generating useKicl_* hooks in afc8245,\nand the docs still showed them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtXr4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk2kQAK5aueIKntW00IFyhKDg35sR\nGKLNsLUAZR2zTq/eIILbH8YgILDDHwvitgEgx3QHMo253UZrixLLNU45msnWjalx\nE/5HTUtzVUaHD+PJEjrfy/QcCwD6+Z0coTkuNAPob7FHsDC7X1L32TKg/AmmCfNm\n0+TUgM1goheVafDRzn9I6ml0cr16tIe4A9OaPAQv5LSA9jvUaUyhoQWRK50CX6Ex\niv7ZHEWGSrHTRmTMa9hV/BkQRewxCsGjt1EuHmCAm0WnBVTAT4GOtWRAJxYUNwFH\nX+N57b4m67Dh0e7XLDl76RTummCstbJo3ESSH7AG+nvE2xthAbcKW9k/3lXkNM2w\ni7eMVXNaNLvmKoPdGsaqLFwxml1RV3yqCZ/vXsSjVt6hrNipDIC9ES7Z42UzKCxe\nc/ta33EF4uOVzlzgekFYMqEi3uPWnqwxbNx83pWGk7PMu+H8LzRdxA9CsMgOqvk5\nspCrXwoSgp7QM0QA7lokYthsSx9v4Ecv9hnfCMnpvheyVjjhjIe1BUQju4uy6lmh\ndgKk9f1yisCw/1n1UREoe8U0ohZUrhXPkKzIBHCy893xNZ59dece+LVMkrFT/rH4\n3hzmm25oxTn8Guy6F