://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/commits/f43550b958f19e7fbc81df1e56b4e2edcad3f5d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:32:56Z","email":"657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Keni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:32:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: build check on pull requests, and Renovate merge rules (#361)\n\n* ci: build check on pull requests, and Renovate merge rules\n\nRenovate PRs had no checks, so nothing showed whether a bump broke the\nbuild. The workflow runs oxlint and the client build on pull requests and\non develop. Stylelint is left out because develop fails it today, and type\nchecking is left out because App/@mf-types is not committed.\n\nRenovate now merges minor and patch devDependency updates once CI passes.\nMajors, three, and the packages shared with the Backend as Module\nFederation singletons always wait for review. react and react-dom are held\nbelow 19.3 because @react-three/fiber 9 declares that range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: enable corepack before setup-node\n\nsetup-node''s yarn cache step calls yarn, and the runner''s global Yarn 1\nrefuses a project whose packageManager is yarn@4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff04c7731e69437253dccf5e1a3029f0193ab50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/trees/ff04c7731e69437253dccf5e1a3029f0193ab50d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL/git/commits/f43550b958f19e7fbc81df1e56b4e2edcad3f5d5","verification":{"payload":"tree ff04c7731e69437253dccf5e1a3029f0193ab50d\nparent 352ae24d1c0735e8a765212145d0df5ea85cbe6b\nauthor Keni <657845+kenilam@users.noreply.github.com> 1790022776 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790022776 -0700\n\nci: build check on pull requests, and Renovate merge rules (#361)\n\n* ci: build check on pull requests, and Renovate merge rules\n\nRenovate PRs had no checks, so nothing showed whether a bump broke the\nbuild. The workflow runs oxlint and the client build on pull requests and\non develop. Stylelint is left out because develop fails it today, and type\nchecking is left out because App/@mf-types is not committed.\n\nRenovate now merges minor and patch devDependency updates once CI passes.\nMajors, three, and the packages shared with the Backend as Module\nFederation singletons always wait for review. react and react-dom are held\nbelow 19.3 because @react-three/fiber 9 declares that range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: enable corepack before setup-node\n\nsetup-node''s yarn cache step calls yarn, and the runner''s global Yarn 1\nrefuses a project whose packageManager is yarn@4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Keni Lam <admin@loci.world>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsZR