rl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/f1185277defd4dda0fd9f4b8ec3fb1f5ac06dc90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:39:03Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:39:03Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: TypeScript 6, and a lockfile from a clean resolution\n\nTypeScript is back on ~6.0.3 and @types/node on ^22, so `npm install` runs\nwithout --legacy-peer-deps again: @typescript-eslint 8 peers typescript\n\">=4.8.4 <6.1.0\", which TypeScript 7 did not satisfy.\n\nBoth lockfiles come from a full install without that flag. The root one has\nthe healthy html-entities layout back - 1.0.10 at the root for sonos-discovery\nand a nested 2.6.0 for @google-cloud/common and eslint-plugin-jsdoc - which the\n--legacy-peer-deps resolution had flattened into the crash reported as\n\"XmlEntities is not a constructor\". The `overrides` entry stays as a guard.\n\n`typescript` is no longer declared in src-widgets: it arrives transitively\nthrough @module-federation/vite. Verified with an empty src-widgets/node_modules\nthat `tsc && vite build` still resolves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SEkA4hPRefGNdWC4NaFxWv","tree":{"sha":"ccbc452195276fb33fa4c11b9e3d7590c478ba15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/ccbc452195276fb33fa4c11b9e3d7590c478ba15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/f1185277defd4dda0fd9f4b8ec3fb1f5ac06dc90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/f1185277defd4dda0fd9f4b8ec3fb1f5ac06dc90","node_id":"C_kwDOAV7u4doAKGYxMTg1Mjc3ZGVmZDRkZGEwZmQ5ZjRiOGVjM2ZiMWY1YWMwNmRjOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8","sha":"849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8"}],"sha":"f1185277defd4dda0fd9f4b8ec3fb1f5ac06dc90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/f1185277defd4dda0fd9f4b8ec3fb1f5ac06dc90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:25:02Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:25:02Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"fix: keep html-entities 1.x for sonos-discovery, ship mf-manifest.json\n\nsonos-discovery 1.7.3 requires `html-entities` 1.0.x and uses the class API\n(`new XmlEntities()`), which version 2 removed. eslint-plugin-jsdoc pulls\nhtml-entities 2.x, and npm hoisted that to the root of node_modules, so the\nadapter crashed on start:\n\n    TypeError: XmlEntities is not a constructor\n    at node_modules/sonos-discovery/lib/models/Player.js:13\n\n`npm ls` marked the tree `invalid` itself. An `overrides` entry pins the\nversion for that dependency, so the resolution no longer depends on hoisting.\n\nAlso: the widget build no longer excludes `mf-manifest.json`. vis-2 requests\nit before `mf-stats.json` to check which React the set was built against\n(src-vis/src/Vis/visWidgetSetCompatibility.ts), so leaving it out produced a\n404 in the browser console on every load.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SEkA4hPRefGNdWC4NaFxWv","tree":{"sha":"e2bac0367731bebd4b51c4a402b9251f9c0d52f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/e2bac0367731bebd4b51c4a402b9251f9c0d52f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8","node_id":"C_kwDOAV7u4doAKDg0OWUzMjIzMDNkMjgwNjM1NDgyMzMzZGViMmEyZWE1YzRkMTQzZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec","sha":"0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec"}],"sha":"849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/849e322303d280635482333deb2a2ea5c4d143e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:43:32Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:43:32Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Updated versions","tree":{"sha":"efd20c141905d0345d26f5919e245609fc146779","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/efd20c141905d0345d26f5919e245609fc146779"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec","node_id":"C_kwDOAV7u4doAKDAyMjBjOWM2OGRkMGI4NDFkMWNmYTBkNzNhMDJhMDU4MzRmZTcxZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f","sha":"f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f"}],"sha":"0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/0220c9c68dd0b841d1cfa0d73a02a05834fe71ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:33:05Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:33:41Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"feat(vis-2): let the React widget replace the vis-1 one\n\nThe React player now uses the template id, set and name of the vis-1 widget\n(`tplSonosControl`, set `sonos`, \"Sonos Control\"), so vis-2 shows it once\ninstead of showing the legacy widget next to it.\n\nTwo mechanisms make that work, both verified in the vis-2 sources:\n* Because io-package.json declares `common.visWidgets`, vis-2 skips\n  `widgets/sonos.html` when it builds `widgets.html`\n  (iobroker.vis-2 src/main.ts, the `widgetSet.v2` branch).\n* Should a legacy template reach the DOM anyway, vis-2 drops it when a React\n  widget returns the same `getWidgetInfo().id` with array `visAttrs`, and the\n  React pass overwrites the legacy entry afterwards\n  (src-vis/src/Vis/visWidgetsCatalog.tsx). React wins either way.\n\nSince the React widget now answers for `tplSonosControl`, views built with the\nvis-1 widget resolve to it when they are opened in vis-2. Those store the\ninstance in `oid` (`sonos.0`), so `oid` stays a declared attribute and\n`Generic.getNamespace()` falls back to it while `instance` is empty.\n\nAlso:\n* `SonosRoom` renamed to `tplSonosRoom` - it has no vis-1 counterpart.\n* Dropped `visWidgets.*.color` from io-package.json: vis-2 takes the set colour\n  from `RxWidgetInfo.visSetColor` and never reads that key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SEkA4hPRefGNdWC4NaFxWv","tree":{"sha":"36d0bf981051b5940d6809eeea21efff978f3b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/36d0bf981051b5940d6809eeea21efff978f3b52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f","node_id":"C_kwDOAV7u4doAKGYxN2U4NzQ4Yzg5MjA3ZTYxODYxNjEyOTVkNjU2ODYxMDQ0NTA2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9","sha":"3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9"}],"sha":"f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/f17e8748c89207e6186161295d6568610445068f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:31:49Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:31:49Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"fix(vis-2): follow the coordinator when its state arrives late\n\nThe library of a group slave is written to the coordinator''s channel, but the\ncoordinator is only known once its own state has been received. Resubscribe\nwhen it changes, otherwise those states are never delivered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SEkA4hPRefGNdWC4NaFxWv","tree":{"sha":"906c103cf07384c56eb9577ac290df7b9e9d0e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/906c103cf07384c56eb9577ac290df7b9e9d0e19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9","node_id":"C_kwDOAV7u4doAKDM4ODljY2RhMDVkMzYxZTIwY2Q3NmExMTFmZGFmOWU4ZDk0NmRmZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commit/ea98ea9c58e210aafb186e24979cee41b626b5bb","sha":"ea98ea9c58e210aafb186e24979cee41b626b5bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/ea98ea9c58e210aafb186e24979cee41b626b5bb"}],"sha":"3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/3889ccda05d361e20cd76a111fdaf9e8d946dff9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/commits/ea98ea9c58e210aafb186e24979cee41b626b5bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:30:36Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:30:36Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"feat: add vis-2 widgets and harden the widget backend\n\nFollow-up to #359.\n\nvis-2 widget set (src-widgets, React 19 / MUI 9, module federation):\n* \"Sonos player\": rooms, grouping, now playing, transport, volume and the\n  library (favorites, playlists, queue, recent tracks, sources)\n* \"Sonos room\": one speaker as a compact card\n* Both bind to an instance and discover the speakers themselves\n* Translations for all 11 languages, registered via `i18n: component`\n* `node tasks.js` builds them into `widgets/sonos/` without touching the\n  vis-1 files that live in the same folder\n\nBackend fixes:\n* TV is offered only on speakers that really have an HDMI/optical input.\n  `getMediaRoot()` listed it unconditionally, so an x-sonos-htastream URI was\n  offered on speakers that reject it. `hasHomeTheater()` probes HTAudioIn of\n  GetZoneInfo and caches the answer per player.\n* Music services are listed only when the household reports them; Spotify and\n  YouTube Music were added unconditionally.\n* Removed the YouTube Music catalog search. It called a private, undocumented\n  Google endpoint with a hardcoded API key and a spoofed browser client.\n* Only the group coordinator runs the elapsed timer. Every member ran its own\n  and wrote to all members, so writes grew with the square of the group size.\n* SMAPI account tokens are written with mode 0600 in a 0700 directory.\n* Transport commands that the TV input rejects are logged as a warning instead\n  of being dropped silently at debug level.\n* The HDMI format poll uses named constants; at 2s it never hit its own 1.5s\n  cache, and it read a state from the database on every tick.\n* `os.tmpdir()` instead of a hardcoded `/tmp` for the SMAPI token fallback.\n\nWidget/repo hygiene:\n* `widgets/sonos/js/sonos.js` and `css/style.css` were byte-identical dead\n  copies of the code inlined in `widgets/sonos.html`. The HTML now references\n  them, so there is one source instead of two.\n* The vis-1 widget no longer hardcodes TV, Spotify and YouTube Music in its\n  fallback source list, and no longer swallows widget errors silently.\n* Removed the fork install instructions from the README.\n* Unit tests for the URI, DIDL, HDMI-format and media-root helpers.\n* CI installs and builds the widget sources.\n* Dependabot auto-merge switched to iobroker-bot-orga/action-automerge-dependabot (#313).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SEkA4hPRefGNdWC4NaFxWv","tree":{"sha":"f1e71c807074beeefa79c020b50bc85698627d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/f1e71c807074beeefa79c020b50bc85698627d07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/ea98ea9c58e210aafb186e24979cee41b626b5bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user