ragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"Add VIS Sonos Control widget for rooms, groups and playlists\n\nShip a classic VIS widget with the adapter so one control can switch\nrooms, manage groups, and start favorites, playlists and queue tracks.\nPlaylist names are now also exposed as adapter states for the widget.\n\nCo-authored-by: kosmix1980 <kosmix1980@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"434ee92744afe2aaa28b9db4b66739dc8381b9f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/trees/434ee92744afe2aaa28b9db4b66739dc8381b9f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sonos/git/commits/f523c0057405119840bf3f582feb9813ce543c9f","verification":{"payload":"tree 434ee92744afe2aaa28b9db4b66739dc8381b9f5\nparent b337189600cf86bd5f30849a0ff21a8acd753151\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1788537374 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1788537374 +0000\n\nAdd VIS Sonos Control widget for rooms, groups and playlists\n\nShip a classic VIS widget with the adapter so one control can switch\nrooms, manage groups, and start favorites, playlists and queue tracks.\nPlaylist names are now also exposed as adapter states for the widget.\n\nCo-authored-by: kosmix1980 <kosmix1980@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEhmQE9dOFKbSZFeKkgJdH0gmPiC1vB2NRHue0KV8jiz3tEIzJy6A8hOU6kgvFJ6N0\nYFSQF5Y7iapT1szpnCdgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T15:56:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g