s from the request; tools run with the rights of the user who asked. Reported by two external security researchers\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: AI assistant answers and log searches longer than 30 seconds ended in an empty answer or \"timeout\"; the result is pushed to the browser now\n- (@GermanBluefox) Added: \"Maximum answer length\" in the settings of the AI assistant (Anthropic)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the news of the notification dialog were always shown in English (#3534)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the notification dialog showed \"undefined\" when a translation was missing\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: Chrome offered to generate and store a password in the API key fields of the credentials","tree":{"sha":"659835b72b6e0c9cd36780cf7fc542224e2c0de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/git/trees/659835b72b6e0c9cd36780cf7fc542224e2c0de8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/git/commits/05f13bb187e88b351c41b1ca4e85638027321d6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscrip