//api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commits/04e32867e48698174ef87786af31b6a288e2082c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:07:25Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:07:25Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Fixed: on a grown installation,","tree":{"sha":"f0620cebca476383c3e89afc53d2897c8d794d1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/git/trees/f0620cebca476383c3e89afc53d2897c8d794d1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/git/commits/04e32867e48698174ef87786af31b6a288e2082c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commit/04e32867e48698174ef87786af31b6a288e2082c","node_id":"C_kwDOAWFLbtoAKDA0ZTMyODY3ZTQ4Njk4MTc0ZWY4Nzc4NmFmMzFiNmEyODhlMjA4MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commit/ca89ef8e5a800f9524f8291b9b02189c55f85563","sha":"ca89ef8e5a800f9524f8291b9b02189c55f85563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commits/ca89ef8e5a800f9524f8291b9b02189c55f85563"}],"sha":"04e32867e48698174ef87786af31b6a288e2082c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commits/04e32867e48698174ef87786af31b6a288e2082c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.admin/commits/ca89ef8e5a800f9524f8291b9b02189c55f85563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:35:39Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:35:39Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v8.0.20\n\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: in the credentials of the system settings, a long translation of the type - \"Benutzerdefiniert\" in German - ran into the ID next to it, because the column had a fixed width that the text did not fit into. The column is wider now, and a translation that is longer still is cut with an ellipsis and shown in full as a tooltip (#3642)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Changed: an object of an adapter can only be deleted in the expert mode now - the delete button in the row, the entry in the context menu and the `Delete` key are gone without it. Deleting such an object can stop the adapter from working, and it is created again at its next start anyway. Objects a user creates themselves (`0_userdata.*` and `alias.*`) can still be deleted without the expert mode (#3639)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: an object whose ID contains a \"/\" - e.g. `ocpp.0./TACW1142021G1543.1.meterValues.Power_Active_Import` - could not be opened from the object tree. The ID went into the URL unencoded, so it was read back cut off at its first slash: the dialog showed the wrong title, the history settings started at 1 January 1970, the \"Chart\" tab disappeared and switching the tab ended in `can''t access property \"ocpp.0.\"`. The ID now survives the round trip through the URL (#3634). Needs `@iobroker/gui-components` 10.3.5\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: in a multihost system, the Log tab asked its own controller whether `getLogs` understands a log level, but sent the request to the selected host. If that host still ran an older js-controller, it answered with the complete log file. The question now goes to the host whose log is shown\n- (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: if a host knows the command `searchLogs` but cannot carry it out - e.g. because it writes no log file at all - the Log tab showed its error. Its files are now read the way those of an older controller are read\n- (@GermanBluefox) 