575ed2db2bd05b267a430407","node_id":"C_kwDOAWFL2NoAKDU5Mzg4MzkzYTliY2EzMDU1NzVlZDJkYjJiZDA1YjI2N2E0MzA0MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/commit/e57e0656af430103980656cccc1f56009a256cf2","sha":"e57e0656af430103980656cccc1f56009a256cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/commits/e57e0656af430103980656cccc1f56009a256cf2"}],"sha":"59388393a9bca305575ed2db2bd05b267a430407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/commits/59388393a9bca305575ed2db2bd05b267a430407"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176587999?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/foxbot76","id":176587999,"login":"foxbot76","node_id":"U_kgDOCoaE3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foxbot76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/commits/e57e0656af430103980656cccc1f56009a256cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:47:04Z","email":"heusinger.moritz@gmail.com","name":"foxbot76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:47:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[OFFICIAL RELEASE] 10.1.2\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Added new rule blocks\n* (@krobipd) Fixed saving of Blockly scripts under Blockly 13: a script containing a named timeout, interval or schedule could not be saved anymore - the save button did not appear (#2349)\n* (@krobipd) Fixed saving of Blockly scripts containing a function with a return value and no statements (#1958)\n* (@krobipd) The Blockly regression tests now also cover saving: every block is serialized the way the editor does it and reloaded to the same code\n* (@krobipd) When a block fails while the script is regenerated after a change, the editor now shows the error instead of silently never offering the save button; a failing export shows its error too","tree":{"sha":"126ca227d0d3a0a800c927e6658901f8682f0b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/git/trees/126ca227d0d3a0a800c927e6658901f8682f0b16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/git/commits/e57e0656af430103980656cccc1f56009a256cf2","verification":{"payload":"tree 126ca227d0d3a0a800c927e6658901f8682f0b16\nparent 17f93057d55d5169293f0eae64a4c93b6b4b8765\nauthor foxbot76 <heusinger.moritz@gmail.com> 1787608024 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787608024 +0000\n\n[OFFICIAL RELEASE] 10.1.2\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Added new rule blocks\n* (@krobipd) Fixed saving of Blockly scripts under Blockly 13: a script containing a named timeout, interval or schedule could not be saved anymore - the save button did not appear (#2349)\n* (@krobipd) Fixed saving of Blockly scripts containing a function with a return value and no statements (#1958)\n* (@krobipd) The Blockly regression tests now also cover saving: every block is serialized the way the editor does it and reloaded to the same code\n* (@krobipd) When a block fails while the script is regenerated after a change, the editor now shows the error instead of silently never offering the save button; a failing export shows its error too","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjLvYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF9QQAF1xK2bLWuOxhYJ/kKsjYjLd\nM1KuOzdYdYz2S9nOtru4xcIPF2H+