stee82","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODEyMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/commits/a8fe07b8978fb764e9b536a9ad0e05f2728d05f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T13:39:19Z","email":"Eistee82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eistee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T13:39:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: AI chat mode tooltip placement and clearer mode descriptions (#2201) (#2230)\n\nFixes issue #2201: when opening the mode dropdown, the hover tooltip\ncovered the first option (\"Chat\") and made it unselectable. The tooltip\nis now anchored to the left of the selector so it sits next to the\nbutton instead of on top of the menu.\n\nAlso rewrote the per-mode descriptions so users can pick the right\nmode based on their model''s capabilities:\n\n- Chat   — plain conversation, works with any model\n- Agent  — for larger models with tool support; reads, creates, and\n           edits scripts, looks up datapoints, browses the object tree\n- Code   — for smaller models without tool support; uses a two-step\n           plan-then-code generator\n\nTranslations updated in all 11 languages (en, de, ru, pt, nl, fr, it,\nes, pl, uk, zh-cn). Stale translation keys for the previous wording\nwere removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83d8ba0cec517881cdeb96beb6c824bd64eb69b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/git/trees/83d8ba0cec517881cdeb96beb6c824bd64eb69b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.javascript/git/commits/a8fe07b8978fb764e9b536a9ad0e05f2728d05f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 83d8ba0cec517881cdeb96beb6c824bd64eb69b7\nparent a0bc321d43f9666615fba74158eb138dda007d44\nauthor Eistee <Eistee82@users.noreply.github.com> 1778074759 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778074759 +0200\n\nfix: AI chat mode tooltip placement and clearer mode descriptions (#2201) (#2230)\n\nFixes issue #2201: when opening the mode dropdown, the hover tooltip\ncovered the first option (\"Chat\") and made it unselectable. The tooltip\nis now anchored to the left of the selector so it sits next to the\nbutton instead of on top of the menu.\n\nAlso rewrote the per-mode descriptions so users can pick the right\nmode based on their model''s capabilities:\n\n- Chat   — plain conversation, works with any model\n- Agent  — for larger models with tool support; reads, creates, and\n           edits scripts, looks up datapoints, browses the object tree\n- Code   — for smaller models without tool support; uses a two-step\n           plan-then-code generator\n\nTranslations updated in all 11 languages (en, de, ru, pt, nl, fr, it,\nes, pl, uk, zh-cn). Stale translation keys for the previous wording\nwere removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+0SHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaWYQACiE929rslLh+hMoB4rgzVf+\n/5L5Ig9ms6a0jLu4MtEMHLvQowK0Kl/QlAj4cbesXqLaZFO4fiG6HJH8goXgeMpt\nY1Leq8upDzz9tzKHH66KbS7HiFf4Q4INZ22agTb9TJQ/Ynu6U314I5yhJl3Bqqjs\nRsB6Q7uhNpYGG3EWYfFUINGTO1V6Xoe0EIrfbyHAwCluLrKKnlKOiwCqN8SbzMEj\npvOIuteMxbwUoVsTWeY/Tv8v4sdypHzjamZCeG1wGyrYCNtTCqlVJFzrHHedePQD\nU/DUqKl9zbNJX5B+DWEmiB2aMPF1AQHEQMjDeMjk7XppMTqRSNql2R94A/0pqWbf\nQOF72yh8ri846PwsIaJw3ks+SgkclM0P3a7ppz3KHG9dSADru4N3dtIsnNruwBug\nskFY+2mDrcfXgNCQ5qhvxjRmJtG6YXXBkueIo8UsxV48y9uOyPGwlXkuSLGoOy/s\ncheRuYfFFEpieiWSSwuZwgU80GwhWn9TxGvzTbukS