lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencomponents/oc/commits/b2c6a63382e7d2eef4fc4ac7e8ddb33b85db24b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:06:16Z","email":"Ricardo.Agullo@theaccessgroup.com","name":"Ricardo Devis Agullo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:06:16Z","email":"Ricardo.Agullo@theaccessgroup.com","name":"Ricardo Devis Agullo"},"message":"feat(registry): add dataProvider.enabled config option\n\nIntroduces a `dataProvider` namespace in the registry configuration with\nan `enabled` flag (default `true`). When set to `false`, the registry\nnever fetches nor runs a component''s `server.js`, even when one exists in\nthe storage: every component is served through the same path already used\nby components that ship no data provider, with the request parameters\npassed through as the view model.\n\nThe option is namespaced rather than flat so that the planned global\nfallback handler and data provider middleware can be added alongside it\nwithout a deprecation cycle.","tree":{"sha":"3143accadd92eaa32394b38fb9d12501a40d5316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencomponents/oc/git/trees/3143accadd92eaa32394b38fb9d12501a40d5316"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencomponents/oc/git/commits/b2c6a63382e7d2eef4fc4ac7e8ddb33b85db24b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16902309?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/followi